{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53388","headline":"送日本国三藏空海上人朝宗我唐兼贡方物而归海东诗（幷序） · 朱千乘","name":"送日本国三藏空海上人朝宗我唐兼贡方物而归海东诗（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古貌宛休公，谈真说苦空。\n应传六祖後，远化岛夷中。\n去岁朝秦阙，今春赴海东。\n威仪易旧体，文字冠儒宗。\n留学幽微旨，云关护法崇。\n凌波无际碍，振锡路何穷。\n水宿鸣金磬，云行侍玉童。\n承恩见明主，偏沐僧家风。\n（收入《弘法大师正传》，见《弘法大师全集》第七卷）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱千乘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}